# References Index — RIE (Reference Intelligence Engine)

Engine: @engine.sdd (pipeline, contract, matrix, fit, evidence,
freshness — read first)
Web references: @web/ (one REF-<n>.sdd per analyzed reference)
Design: @design/patterns.sdd (distilled patterns), @design/decisions.sdd

Rules:
  [REF-01] References feed decisions; never clone assets/code/markup.
  [REF-02] Intent must be recorded before analysis (default INSPIRE).
  [REF-03] Every adopted pattern carries source REF + reason.
  [REF-04] Reference never overrides project rules ([R110]).
  [REF-05] Research cases are re-runnable (DR-<n> reuse; staleness
           triggers re-analysis on demand).

State: +
